# MathTiba runs 100% functionally with NO environment variables set.
# All math verification (app/api/verify, app/api/check-answer) is exact
# BigInt arithmetic in TypeScript — zero external services, zero API keys.
#
# Optional: enable the generative-AI session summary on /report
# (app/api/explain). This route NEVER verifies or computes mathematics —
# it only phrases already-computed facts into a short natural-language
# paragraph. Without this key, /report shows an equivalent
# deterministic, data-driven summary instead — nothing breaks either way.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# engine/verify.py + vercel.json are an optional SymPy mirror of the
# TypeScript verifier, for Vercel Python Functions deployments. Not
# required and not called by the frontend by default.
